# Phantom Interference, "+ {1} — Counter target spell unless its controller pays {2}.": {U}{1} in all, two Moxen. On turn 2 Bot2
# (one Island) casts an Ornithopter: Bot2 cannot pay {2} with one mana, declines, and the Ornithopter is countered. On turn 4 Bot2
# casts another with two Islands untapped and pays exactly {2}: it is not countered and enters. Nothing but the countering
# happens: no Spirit token is made.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Ruby
Phantom Interference
Phantom Interference
Island x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Island
Ornithopter
Ornithopter
Island x15

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Phantom Interference.Cast
Bot1.Modes(Counter target spell unless its controller pays {2})
Bot1.Target(Stack.Ornithopter)
Bot1.Pass
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot2.Battlefield.Island.Activate
! Bot2.PayCost
Bot2.Decline
? Bot2.Graveyard = Ornithopter
? Bot2.Battlefield = Island
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Phantom Interference.Cast
Bot1.Modes(Counter target spell unless its controller pays {2})
Bot1.Target(Stack.Ornithopter)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Island#2.Activate
Bot2.PayCost

[Expect]
Stack.Count = 0
Bot1.Graveyard = Phantom Interference; Phantom Interference
Bot2.Graveyard = Ornithopter
Bot2.Battlefield = Island; Island; Ornithopter
Bot1.Battlefield = Mox Sapphire; Mox Ruby
